dcshift audio filter (src/audio/dcshift.ts)

src/audio/dcshift.ts adapts FFmpeg libavfilter/af_dcshift.c: the shift and
limitergain options with their ranges, the limiter threshold computed in init(),
the three limiter branches and the unlimited path of filter_frame() in double
arithmetic, the int64 truncation and av_clipl_int32 clipping, and the pinned
s32p sample format (FILTER_SINGLE_SAMPLEFMT).

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
